# Grok-only media

This project has **no BFL account**. Never call BFL, Flux, `flux.py`, or Black Forest Labs.

Images and videos are created with the **Grok** model only:

1. Stills — Cursor `GenerateImage` (Grok).
2. Video — Grok image/video tools. Do not invent footage with Luma, Runway, or ffmpeg.

ffmpeg, WebP, and JPEG are convert/encode only. They may compress or loop a file Grok already made. They must not be the first creator of a picture or film.

If Grok cannot generate, stop and say so. Do not fall back to BFL.